ideo></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ll be waiting for you on top of the blocks, with a bunch of quirky ol' blokes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757020/extras/93b79344c8641dab33925cd247387da7.avif?t=1755524785\" width=600 height=220 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "BLOKES on BLOCKS is a casual party game where you push your friends around. With simple controls this game is easy to pick up and play, suitable for everyone. Your actions happen just by moving around. Timing is everything so predict your blokes' next moves and knock them off their blocks!",
